{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_048_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:88ca6189ef22df334531c7bd1b386fefaf6128432b0bdcd8667cf64ced129da3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdfa4cd1a4fffcd05bb4e172380df923b0ead3078bf265027f0aafd6b5370696",
      "text": "咦？百百人先生，\n装在那个包包里的东西是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02dbd65fbf449340f622c23669419ac6b97203945c81d08600e26daf7edd94e4",
      "text": "啊，被发现了。P酱送我的巧克力，\n因为舍不得，一直没能下口吃……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3edee263f0e1090a7ed8ed56f78fa5dd7754e8a83bcd464ee208fe6785757d49",
      "text": "你能这么珍惜，我很高兴，\n但要是就这么一直放着，会坏掉的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27d90439fc77f18f27c0e6522836363d8d67855df57b22b8c58c04fa64992cc",
      "text": "嗯。我知道必须快点吃掉才行。\n可是，一旦吃了就没有了嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5520bed8d9362edf22f63020f5011ca8a0e9cd586ecd1a5fa9ee6c63306f1ad",
      "text": "是这样呢……虽然在实体上无法留存，\n但回忆会一直留下来——这样想觉得如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de3213899a147f7d9de0d82828a2b486fd35da9f22d1606c23e128be1fa936c8",
      "text": "回忆会留下来……吗。\n这样啊，那要是那样的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:116364bad3dd89aca18ce1930e52e00e7375094fecf42fbd8c4a3bdccf4ae476",
      "text": "我，想和P酱一起吃呢。\n那样的话，就能作为珍贵的回忆留存下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a061c5d4a7f422c8ff02b991a95f1642386a22b3cb3eaee45a230d772ef56b2",
      "text": "只要这样你能吃下的话，我明白了！\n我们一起吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8521b9453d82e930705f99398ac900526db557e6421f8cf4dee80179da9508a3",
      "text": "太棒啦。那么…………嗯，又甜又好吃。\n接下来，换我喂P酱吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_048_23:5_01_048_23_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6279a8f8c36315567b5d6e6edd7d648506e42c2d0b15251567f9e2f1eae801a0",
      "text": "一起吃，就是这个意思对吧？\n所以……来。想要你啊——张开嘴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
